damaged_code:
```java
finally {
    if (stmt != null) {
        stmt.close(); // Throws SQLException, next lines are skipped!
    }
    if (conn != null) {
        conn.close();
    }
}
```

fix:
Isolate each fallible cleanup call in its own try-catch block, ensuring subsequent calls execute.
```java
finally {
    if (stmt != null) {
        try { stmt.close(); } catch (SQLException e) { /* log */ }
    }
    if (conn != null) {
        try { conn.close(); } catch (SQLException e) { /* log */ }
    }
}
```
